{"id":"torrey:nineveh","source":"torrey","name":"Nineveh","slug":"nineveh","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Origin and antiquity of — Ge 10:11.","refs":[["Gen",10,11,10,11]]},{"text":"Situated on the river Tigris — Na 2:6,8.","refs":[["Nah",2,6,2,6],["Nah",2,8,2,8]]},{"text":"The ancient capital of Assyria — 2Ki 19:36; Isa 37:37.","refs":[["2Kgs",19,36,19,36],["Isa",37,37,37,37]]},{"text":"Called the bloody city — Na 3:1.","refs":[["Nah",3,1,3,1]]},{"text":"Great. — Jon 1:2; 3:2.","refs":[["Jonah",1,2,1,2],["Jonah",3,2,3,2]]},{"text":"Extensive. — Jon 3:3.","refs":[["Jonah",3,3,3,3]]},{"text":"Rich. — Na 2:9.","refs":[["Nah",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"Strong. — Na 3:12.","refs":[["Nah",3,12,3,12]]},{"text":"Commercial. — Na 3:16.","refs":[["Nah",3,16,3,16]]},{"text":"Populous. — Jon 4:11.","refs":[["Jonah",4,11,4,11]]},{"text":"Vile. — Na 1:14.","refs":[["Nah",1,14,1,14]]},{"text":"Wicked. — Jon 1:2.","refs":[["Jonah",1,2,1,2]]},{"text":"Idolatrous. — Na 1:14.","refs":[["Nah",1,14,1,14]]},{"text":"Full of joy and carelessness. — Zep 2:15.","refs":[["Zeph",2,15,2,15]]},{"text":"Full of lies and robbery. — Na 3:1.","refs":[["Nah",3,1,3,1]]},{"text":"Full of witchcraft. — Na 3:4.","refs":[["Nah",3,4,3,4]]},{"text":"Jonah sent to proclaim the destruction of — Jon 1:2; 3:1,2,4.","refs":[["Jonah",1,2,1,2],["Jonah",3,1,3,1],["Jonah",3,2,3,2],["Jonah",3,4,3,4]]},{"text":"Inhabitants of, repented at Jonah’s preaching — Jon 3:5-9; Mt 12:41; Lu 11:32.","refs":[["Jonah",3,5,3,9],["Matt",12,41,12,41],["Luke",11,32,11,32]]},{"text":"Destruction of, averted — Joh 3:10; 4:11.","refs":[["John",3,10,3,10],["John",4,11,4,11]]},{"text":"Coming up of the Babylonish armies against. — Na 2:1-4; 3:2.","refs":[["Nah",2,1,2,4],["Nah",3,2,3,2]]},{"text":"Destruction of its people. — Na 1:12; 3:3.","refs":[["Nah",1,12,1,12],["Nah",3,3,3,3]]},{"text":"Spoiling of its treasures. — Na 2:9.","refs":[["Nah",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"Destruction of its idols. — Na 1:14; 2:7.","refs":[["Nah",1,14,1,14],["Nah",2,7